[68e9b91c] 2026-10-26T20:30:39.727Z: When dealing with date ranges, I found that consistently converting to epoch time before comparing yields better results.
[d656212a] 2026-10-26T19:30:42.976Z: State names can be ambiguous. Check for county names that appear in multiple states, especially if state_fips is not unique.
